    <string name="instructions">Tap the floating button to mute or unmute.\nHold briefly, then drag to move it.\nDrag it to the bottom edge of the screen to hide it (like chat bubbles).\nLong press it to show or hide the volume percentage.\nThe notification allows you to hide and show it at any time.\nYou can also quit the app by tapping on \'Stop\' in the notification.\nTap on the notification to open the app so you can change the settings.</string>

